        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 528
        },
        "id": "GXjWOPpxUZd4",
        "outputId": "c5313689-dae6-4689-8cf8-1f4364bf9858"
      },
      "execution_count": 73,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "display_data",
          "data": {
            "text/plain": [
              "<Figure size 1500x500 with 1 Axes>"
            ],
            "image/png": "\n"
          },
          "metadata": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "La correlacion decae bruscamente luego de 2 pasos. Pareciera haber una correlacion parcial de orden 2\n",
        "Aunque el 3er valor tambien parece ser significativo"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "3Vczi4d1UeqD"
      }
